(7202067, 1108115, 173844, '<td valign="top">Though I didn''t comment on the pictures in this challenge, I did cast votes and this was my clear favorite.  Although this image is steeped in pain, it''s swaddled in beauty.  It''s like a finely controlled charcoal drawing that both plummets and soars in tonation.  You have to make some effort to discern the face, which then easily transmogrifies into a skull.  Then there''s the dagger of a pipe.  The background has a cubist feel.  I don''t know what white object in the upper right is, but I choose to think it''s an ax.</td>', 'Though I didn''t comment on the pictures in this challenge, I did cast votes and this was my clear favorite.  Although this image is steeped in pain, it''s swaddled in beauty.  It''s like a finely controlled charcoal drawing that both plummets and soars in tonation.  You have to make some effort to discern the face, which then easily transmogrifies into a skull.  Then there''s the dagger of a pipe.  The background has a cubist feel.  I don''t know what white object in the upper right is, but I choose to think it''s an ax.', '2014-04-11 16:05:24.000000', NULL, 0),
